SUMMARY:Carolina Craft Day
DESCRIPTION:Carolina Craft Day\nOctober 3\, 2026\n10:00 a.m. – 3:00 p.m.\nThe Appalachian region has a rich history of crafts and art. Carolina Craft Day showcases traditional and contemporary crafts of our region. Purchase crafts from local artists. Vendors and musicians will be stationed in the Heritage Garden and on Baker Lawn. \nVendors:\nPisgah Banjos\nMelanie Wilder (textiles and yarn dyeing; craft demos)\nWNC Wood (walking sticks and wood craft)\nDarcy Ward (metal work) \nTorched AVL (metalwork\, jewelry\, craft; craft demos)\nTrollgada (fishing lures)\nSkye Tafoya & Jakeli Swimmer (earrings\, prints)\nHannah Gambino (ceramics)
URL:https://ncarboretum.org/event/carolina-craft-day/
CATEGORIES:Events
